{"overview":"یک تراژدی. یک پوشش‌دادن. یک حساب‌رسی که هنوز بدهکار است. «روبودیبت» طرح ظالمانه و غیرقانونی دولت بود که جان‌ها را گرفت و میلیون‌ها دلار هزینه کرد. این‌ها داستان کسانی است که از این طرح محافظت کردند و کسانی که به‌خاطر آن پرداخت کردند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A tragedy. A cover-up. A reckoning still owed. Robodebt was the cruel and illegal government scheme that took lives and cost millions. These are the stories of those who protected the scheme, and those who paid for it.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":4,"y":2026,"poster":""}],"episodes":4,"crew":["Jennifer Leacey","Magda Wozniak","Sophie Miller"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["AU"],"cast":[{"name":"Kate Box","role":"Jenny Miller","photo":"/zv4NckgNBn6Tc2xhCdNFFx9o9EZ.jpg"},{"name":"Justine Clarke","role":"Colleen Taylor","photo":"/nqNBHuEWSLr9mKExkUSiTNhIs2e.jpg"},{"name":"Mandy McElhinney","role":"Malisa Golightly","photo":"/zYWzsZ8yDI3XQCjVix75F2KHGIc.jpg"},{"name":"Sarah Peirse","role":"Catherine Holmes","photo":"/wC9OFU4mFkK1N6r6UU6A0E7pBTr.jpg"},{"name":"Jack Patten","role":"Rhys Cauzzo","photo":"/sIE11wI7czGjYCUOlEKqXguIdsl.jpg"},{"name":"Alison Bell","role":"Kath Madgwick","photo":"/f8Km3JnZ42AXe0xZB7tXKOTdqcm.jpg"},{"name":"Victoria Haralabidou","role":"Sandra Bevan","photo":"/jxi0sPlTS2IR8dJdjBEkMl1PIzr.jpg"},{"name":"Stephen Peacocke","role":"Greg Miller","photo":"/y5rEVZ7NCkBKDhmOlMl6q1nONpz.jpg"},{"name":"Claire van der Boom","role":"Rachelle Miller","photo":"/1CXZLmtimJksArEZ5afDIH6prwW.jpg"}],"trailer":"zIB_DZs49G4","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/338661"}